  "description": "A managed GRIB2 decoder for wind and wave grids: sections 0 to 8 with several messages per file and repeated sections, the regular latitude/longitude grid (template 3.0), analysis and forecast products and their time-interval statistics (templates 4.0 and 4.8), simple, complex, spatially differenced, JPEG 2000 and PNG packing (templates 5.0, 5.2, 5.3, 5.40 and 5.41, with a managed JPEG 2000 Part 1 decoder) and the bitmap. Indexes the fields when a file opens, decodes values only when asked, and maps fields onto the EncDotNet.S100.Datasets.Weather grid model. No native dependencies. Not for navigation.",
